From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Lopez <norelec@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:42:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Name the application WispUO

Avalonia calls an unnamed application "Avalonia Application", and macOS shows
that in the menu bar. The name is set in the constructor, before the platform
starts: set from App.axaml it came too late for the menu bar.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFcBNQtF3Z7vfzi99BXwUe
---
 ClassicAssist.Avalonia/App.axaml.cs | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ClassicAssist.Avalonia/App.axaml.cs b/ClassicAssist.Avalonia/App.axaml.cs
index cb63037..1cc498d 100644
--- a/ClassicAssist.Avalonia/App.axaml.cs
+++ b/ClassicAssist.Avalonia/App.axaml.cs
@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@ namespace ClassicAssist.Avalonia;
 
 public class App : Application
 {
+    // Set before the platform starts: from App.axaml it came too late for the macOS menu bar.
+    public App()
+    {
+        Name = "WispUO";
+    }
+
     public override void Initialize()
     {
         AvaloniaXamlLoader.Load( this );
